This directory is for startup-time scripts/services.

Conventions:
- Modules here run during startup or are invoked from startup hooks.
- Keep a stable external API when possible (`setup()`, optional explicit actions).
- Put startup orchestration in `init.lua`; keep script internals here.
- Keep files focused on one startup concern (example: repo auto-update).

Current module:
- `update_git_repo.lua`: background git fetch/pull check for this config repo.
